                                "sense_id": "d757a927-6960-3f6e-9205-ec18033c6d66",
                                "text": "But a fish-market, even at Rialto […] is only a fish-market after all: it is wet and slimy under foot, and the innumerable gigantic eels, writhing everywhere, set the soul asquirm, and soon-sated curiosity slides willingly away."
                            },
