                                "example_id": "c084ef31-0386-4856-9ac8-5b25691022b5",
                                "sense_id": "d757a927-6960-3f6e-9205-ec18033c6d66",
                                "text": "[…] he sat with his trousers rolled up to the knees and his blue-white city toes asquirm in the cleanest muck he’d ever felt."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8818b475-7b9b-4746-9d8d-00fcd91ea69c",
                                "sense_id": "d757a927-6960-3f6e-9205-ec18033c6d66",
                                "text": "From where they sat on the rowing thwarts, they made blind passes with their herring rakes, bringing them up with silver asquirm on each needle-sharp tooth."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ab7a9447-9e7a-4e25-b5ed-eaa1f4bc0bb1",
                                "sense_id": "d757a927-6960-3f6e-9205-ec18033c6d66",
                                "text": "[…] this child, unlike the first, was easily stirred to rages. The slightest discomfort set her asquirm […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
