                                "example_id": "7747f4ff-060c-4f2c-aa61-4a14fdaf6c42",
                                "sense_id": "2553c693-8d88-3d65-b479-b19b61e63a0d",
                                "text": "[…] such supplies as did arrive were as often as not scarcely fit to eat, the bread moldy, the biscuit asquirm with weevils, the butter rancid […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e2bceb8b-bda6-4e5d-9b08-8fbb584a01d8",
